-- src:766 | of the body corporate, and includes any person
-- src:767 | purporting to act in any such capacity; or
-- src:769 | (b) in relation to an unincorporated association (other
-- src:770 | than a partnership), means the president, the
-- src:771 | secretary, or any member of the committee of the
-- src:772 | unincorporated association, or any person holding a
