`s 16(5)(a) the person is an officer of a body corporate` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF position EQUALS `no such position`
        -- NOTHING-kind (includes): the definition "means" the listed officers "and includes" a person purporting to act, and does not say that no one else is an officer
        THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- s 16(5) "officer" in relation to an unincorporated association (other than a
