    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the partner is guilty where the offence by the partnership "is proved" to have been committed with "the consent or connivance of a partner" or to be attributable to "neglect"
    ELSE NOTHING

-- s 16(4): an unincorporated association other than a partnership.  The person is
-- an officer, or a member of the governing body.
-- src:741 | (4) Where an offence under this Act committed by an
-- src:742 | unincorporated association (other than a partnership) is proved —
