      `the offence was committed with the consent or connivance of the officer or member` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offence is attributable to neglect on the part of the officer or member` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 16(4) the officer or member is guilty of the offence as well as the unincorporated association` MEANS
