       AND `an offence under this Act committed by the unincorporated association is proved`
       AND (officer EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `the person is a member of its governing body`)
       AND (`the offence was committed with the consent or connivance of the officer or member` OR `the offence is attributable to neglect on the part of the officer or member`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
