`s 20(2) the Minister may make regulations for or with respect to the matter` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF matter EQUALS `another matter`
        -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the matters are listed "Without limiting subsection (1)", so a matter not listed is for subsection (1) to answer
        THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

